# The Convener's generated speech. Byte-exact by rule, not by git's binary
# guess: a CRLF conversion would corrupt every mp3, and it would corrupt them
# on the Linux checkout Vercel builds from, not on the Windows machine that
# committed them — the failure would be invisible until the audio was live.
packages/web/public/trades-house-media/voice/*.mp3 -text
